Builder Design Pattern:
======================
   ○ Builder Design Pattern helps to construct complex objects step-by-step.
   ○ It is used when an object requires many optional fields or has a long list of parameters.

Where it is used ?
==================
   ○ To create immutable objects.
   ○ When there are multiple optional parameters.
   ○ When you want cleaner and more readable object construction.


Concept Explanation:
====================
 ○ Imagine you have a User class, with 10 fields, some optional and some mandatory.
 ○ Instead of writing many constructors, you can use the Builder pattern.


